{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201100","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620110001:1":{"text":"교수님, 묘지에서 소란을 피우는 녀석을 찾아볼게요. 그러니까 비츠와프의 시험 준비를 도와주세요!","source_cn":"教授，我们答应帮你调查那个在墓地捣蛋的人，请你帮维茨瓦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D128B978AD30AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620110002:1":{"text":"하지만 지금은 단서가 너무 부족해요. 혹시 범인을 본 적은 없나요? 범인의 특징은 뭐가 있죠?","source_cn":"不过，现在线索实在太少了。你有没有见过这个犯人，他有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43242E7EAE7509B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620110003:1":{"text":"내가 범인을 봤다면 너희에게 조사를 시켰겠니?","source_cn":"我要是见过犯人，还找你们调查干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335E2C625F751AF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620110004:1":{"text":"내가 줄 수 있는 단서는 많지 않아. 소란은 한 달 전부터 시작됐는데, 밤만 되면 누가 내 묘비 앞에서 뛰어다녀서 조용히 쉴 수가 없었지.","source_cn":"我能提供的线索不多。作乱事件是在一个月前开始的，一到晚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x084E5F07E2E47ABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620110005:1":{"text":"너무 시끄러워서 유령이 되어 잡으러 나왔는데, 내가 나올 때마다 귀신같이 도망쳐서 얼굴을 본 적이 없단다.","source_cn":"气得我变成幽灵爬出来想要抓人，可每次我一出现，那个人就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9738982BF1042931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620110006:1":{"text":"음... 그렇긴 해도 한 달 동안 매일 공동묘지에 왔다면 분명히 주변에 흔적을 남기지 않았을까요?","source_cn":"唔……虽说如此，但这个人连续一个月晚上跑来墓园，多少会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C27BA2AC4E6B9BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620110007:1":{"text":"그래. 그런 흔적은 아주 중요한 단서지.","source_cn":"没错，这些踪迹都是珍贵的线索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43267F5F63879B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620110008:1":{"text":"나는 묘비를 떠날 수 없어. 그러니 조사는 너희에게 맡길게.","source_cn":"我不能离开墓碑，调查的事就交给你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23AC74FF816CA055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620110009:1":{"text":"치피가 방금 주변을 둘러봤는데, 여긴 그냥 평범한 공동묘지 같아요... 대체 어디서부터 단서를 찾아야 하는 걸까요?","source_cn":"满满刚刚看了一圈，这里就是很正常的墓园……要从哪里开始...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37DCB835DA3BFFE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620110010:1":{"text":"일단 <style=\"highlight\">공동묘지 주변 사람들에게 물어봐요</style>. 목격자가 있을 수도 있으니까요.","source_cn":"先去<style=highlight>问问墓园周围的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11DA7CEDDCAC8524","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620110011:1":{"text":"저도 도울게요! 저 이래 봬도 조사하고 추리하는 건 꽤 믿을 만하거든요!","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！别看我这样，调查推理能力还是很靠谱的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCE5C377844179E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亚娜奇卡":{"text":"아나치카","source":"亚娜奇卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:魔法师维茨瓦夫":{"text":"마법사 비츠와프","source":"魔法师维茨瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}}